name: Roland TR-808 Sound Sample Set
author: Michael Fischer (Technopolis), 1994
license: Free of charge, no explicit redistribution terms
source-url: https://github.com/tidalcycles/Dirt-Samples/blob/master/808/TR808.TXT
note: Via Dirt-Samples. TR808.TXT states the set is free but grants no redistribution or sublicensing terms. The closed and foot hat are 808/CH.WAV, the set's only closed hi-hat (until 2026-11-12 they were a High Conga from 808hc, mislabelled). The snare's soft layer and ghost, a snappy-off snare, were replaced by the default snare.
